WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.470
It's time at last.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:13.010
The evening sun sets on my life-ucha.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.560
No breaking Sapanna rules!

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.080
After the festival comes feast!

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.940
Non, congratulations on winning today.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.560
Thanks!

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:07.560
What's wrong?

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:10.240
It's that promise with Pepper!

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:14.570
That if we won the Divine Idol
Grand Prix together, Pepper could eat her!

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:17.570
What's that? Usacha's being eat...

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.450
Cheers!

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:25.990
We worked our fur off this year too-usa!

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:28.920
We sure did-kuma!

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:32.340
And my little sister Usacha put in every effort to lead NonSugar to victory, too-usa!

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:35.210
Ucha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha!

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:38.130
We'll have to hold a party to celebrate-usa!

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:42.550
Beary true! Usacha's really grown up beautifully-kuma!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:45.350
It's hard to think she was once just a little baby-kuma...

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:47.640
You ain't met her till years after that, moron-usa!

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.810
Ah, yer right!

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.760
What going on?

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.550
If I can keep you trapped like this, there's nothing to worry about.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.990
Why trap Pepper?

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:01.960
This is a plan Onee-chan and I came up with! Right?

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:05.200
Mm-hm! You just sit there quietly where we can see you, Pepper!

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.120
Ran-ny!

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:12.130
No, I'm not Granny. I'm Mama's Mama.

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:14.020
Ran-ny!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.840
Fish is super oily! Fun to eat!

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.550
Um, yes...

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:24.240
So why is it that we have to look after this girl through the winter holidays?

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.680
Please, Mum!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:28.140
There's a proper reason for this, we promise!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:33.810
But you know, Pepper-chan,
you have to eat your vegetables too.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.270
Bummer.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:41.820
Hey, I think Jululu's hungry too.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.240
I guess that makes it lunchtime for Jululu.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:48.610
Say, that reminds me.
You said Jululu was walking now, didn't you?

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.660
She's only doing it every now and then.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.420
Oh, I'd have loved to see it!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:57.130
Here you go, Granny's special pumpkin soup!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:57.810
Gra–

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:01.280
You eat up all your veggies
like a good girl, don't you, Jululu?

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:02.310
Say "ah".

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.730
Come on, Pepper, you too.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:06.700
Ooh-ooh.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:15.270
Napoli-man, today I had to sauté
a whole heap of rabbit meat, Ischia-style.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.280
Oh!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.350
Rabbit.

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:19.610
Meat!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:20.690
Dad!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.320
No talking about rabbits!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.840
Hopping up, up like a bunny – up high!

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.540
I just told you: no talking about rabbits!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.210
Come on Jululu, let's play over here.

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:38.670
Jululu!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.730
Over here, yeah!

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:44.730
There we go... and back to you!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.240
You're so good, Jululu!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.380
Okay, here it comes...

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.690
Say, Pepper, why don't you...

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:58.690
Hm?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.570
Pepper's gone.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:08.210
No breaking Sapanna rules!

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:12.080
After the festival comes feast!

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:20.370
I wonder where Janice went to afterwards...

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:23.980
Janice...

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.880
Oh, Non.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:32.720
We've got trouble! Pepper's run off!

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:33.810
She must have gone to PriPara!

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.770
Okay! I'll be there very soon!

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:44.620
Oh, I just hope Pepper hasn't eaten Usacha yet!

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:57.310
Again? I'm stuck in perpetual vanquishment.

00:05:57.310 --> 00:06:00.640
What? Even though you're the school-level go champion, you can't win?

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:04.360
Heh, I'm all "successive victory" over here!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.380
Dorothy!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:11.130
It's able to ascertain plays with a high likelihood of success in but a moment.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.740
So what's that mean?

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.220
It means it's very powerful.

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.270
But I'm sure you'll be able to win, Shion.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.770
Pushu... Pushu...

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.730
Usacha...

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:24.320
Pushu... Pushu...

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.220
Pushu...

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:28.320
Oh no! Lady Sophie!

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:33.700
Lady Sophie, you were amazing today-chanko!
You made it to the seventh telephone pole-chanko!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:39.400
But if you used the sour sour plum supplements Shikyouin-san gave you, you'd be able to run more easily.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:41.680
No, I'm fine.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.770
I'm going to become tasty fried rabbit-ucha.

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:58.270
Hop!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:06:59.530
Cha!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:01.870
Cha!

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.650
Cha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha!

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:11.080
Let's celebrate together with Usacha-usa!

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.000
We'll have a real feast-kuma!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.430
Fried carrots too-usa!

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:16.760
With the batter...

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:17.830
A-crunch!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.210
And the filling...

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.670
Velvet-smooth!

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:24.090
Usacha's gonna love it-kuma!
Usacha's gonna love it-usa!

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:24.880
Huh?

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.590
Usacha!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:30.200
Kuma!

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:30.820
Nii-cha!

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:33.970
So what's going on-usa? Quite the outfit there...

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:34.800
Cha...

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:38.480
Oh, I know-usa. It's a picnic, right-usa?

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:41.170
Your Nii-cha was just thinking it'd be great to celebrate,

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:46.770
so we got Neko-neesan to prepare a luxurious three-tier lunch-usa...

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.860
We must be telepathically linked... hey!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.650
Usacha?

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.030
What's going on-kuma?

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:57.990
I chased after rabbits on that mountain...

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.040
Pepper?

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.350
Hey, it's Kuma and Usagi-pri!

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:02.000
Kuma?
Usa?

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.850
Hey, you guys! Have you seen Usacha around?

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.630
Hm? What's this-kuma?

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.550
What? A will?

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.890
What? What? What? What?

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:23.350
Usacha made that kind of promise with Pepper-usa?

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.810
No – No way!

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:29.140
Nii-cha here knew nothing-usa...

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:31.490
Nor me!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:34.610
To think I changed all those nappies for her when she was a baby!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.200
Oh, what do I do now-kuma?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:37.900
The heck you did-usa!

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.200
I guess not!

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:45.120
I think Jululu's saying we should hurry up and go help them!

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.130
Usacha!
You go it-usa!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.280
My imaginary little sister!

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.130
We should s-pri-t up and look for them.

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:54.550
Capisce!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.870
May I be simmered deliciously-ucha.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:09.480
U...

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.070
There she is!

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.900
Usacha! Don't do it-kuma!
Usacha! Don't do it-usa!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.820
Ouch! It's hot! It's hot!

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.790
Usacha's not here-pri.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:21.930
She's gone.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:28.920
Cha, cha... cha.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.180
Cha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.500
There she is!

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:41.600
Usacha!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.480
Ouch! It's hot! It's hot!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.860
Ah, she escaped again-pri!

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.560
Fried, curried, hand-rolled sushi...

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.890
These must be Pepper's favourites-pri!

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:58.590
Hey, that reminds me. Today she was scarfing down dried mackerel!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:09:59.520
Dried mackerel?

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:00.710
Macker-all right!

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:16.760
I will consummate my life as a dried rabbit,
bursting with umami-ucha.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.350
There she is!

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:21.180
Kuma!
Usacha!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.790
Ouch! It's hot! It's hot!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.570
Usacha's gone again-pri!
Ouch! It's hot! It's hot!

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:31.190
Are you both okay?
Ouch! It's hot! It's hot!

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:31.200
Are you both okay?

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:35.080
Rabbit, rabbit!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.950
How should I eat you?

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:43.770
I will eat you as a steak, rabbit!

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.200
As a steak-ucha?

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.290
Noted, noted.

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.080
Usacha, where are you?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.800
Usacha! Hurry and show yourself before us!

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:58.490
Where could she have gone?

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:02.220
Actually, there's something else I'm worried about.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.720
Hm?

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:07.680
Janice hasn't returned since the Grand Prix.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.100
Oh!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:13.340
And she can't leave the Rosette.

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:16.030
I'm worried she might have fallen into a river or such!

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:36.670
Why was I unable to act back then?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.640
<i>I couldn't!</i>

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.800
<i>Divine Idol Grand Prix...</i>

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.100
<i>Onee-sama!</i>

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.190
<i>The baton...</i>

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.140
<i>Switch on!</i>

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.270
<i>The baton!</i>

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:54.610
<i>I can't.</i>

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:58.070
<i>But what is this feeling stopping me?</i>

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:02.530
What was that feeling stopping me back then?

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:06.320
No, justice must be upheld.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:10.030
That is the true path for a goddess!

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:11.770
Oh, but!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:17.040
But I'm so confused!

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:21.880
There sure are a lot of places in PriPara, huh?

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.220
Hey, over there!

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:26.720
Oh!

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.670
It's the Rosette!

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:31.830
You there, cow! Prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:34.580
Yoink.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.190
H–Hey! What are you...

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:39.020
Let me go! Hey! Let me go, I say!

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.940
Janice, we've got trouble!

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:43.950
Is something the matter?

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.050
Indeed. You see, Pepper...

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:50.120
We've gotta look for her from the sky-pri.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.540
Yeah.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:53.170
Sophie, could you?

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.030
Yes.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.040
So Usacha...

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:05.930
I see. So that's how it was.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:09.140
Janice, what should we do?

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.640
Oh...

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:14.030
No, a promise is a promise.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.600
One should respect such rules.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.060
What?

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.150
So we shouldn't impede them?

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.700
I can't stand by and let that happen!

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.120
Neither can I!

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:27.700
You were observing Usacha's efforts this whole time, too – weren't you, Janice?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:32.260
That's right! We were only able to win because of Usacha!

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:35.260
Janice!

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:36.330
Hm?

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:40.290
For what sake do your rules exist?

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.300
Eh? My... rules?

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.440
Rules are imperative.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:54.830
My sister's actions are not for the betterment of PriPara.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:56.590
So someone must protect its order.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.030
Anyway, Chiri, we should go and look for them.

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:00.940
Indeed.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.230
Your goddess rules don't make sense to me!

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.890
My rules...

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:15.700
My justice...

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.460
I'm getting more and more confused!

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:26.290
Usacha and I used to come to this mountain for picnics...

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:28.800
She might have come here-usa!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.570
Usacha! Your nii-cha's here-usa!

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:35.270
Come on, where are you-usa?

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:39.530
Usacha! Kuma's here too-kuma!

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:42.480
Oh, Usacha, what will become of the sweet girl
I bathed with when she was a baby-kuma?

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.570
Kuma!
Quit messing around!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.830
Kuma-ma-ma... Oh!

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.030
Hey, look!

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.110
Over there!

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.580
Usacha's getting ready to make herself into a steak-kuma!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.710
She's what? Making herself into a steak-usa?

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:00.100
It's true-usa!

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:01.540
Gimme that-kuma!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:06.010
Oh no! Pepper's approaching-kuma!

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:09.280
Oh no! And now Usacha's salted and peppered herself!

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:10.550
Usa!

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:18.930
Time for rabbit! Time for rabbit!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.900
Time for rabbit! Time for...

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.520
Oh no-usa! I have to save Usacha-usa!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.360
Me too-kuma!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:26.720
Usa!

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:29.570
Kuma!
Usa!

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.870
Usacha? Pepper?

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.120
Usacha!

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:45.480
Farewell, Nii-cha. Farewell, everyone.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:48.130
I'm going to become a delicious steak-ucha!

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.930
Ucha!

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:52.630
Usacha!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.180
No, Usacha! Stop!

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:00.930
Ouch! It's hot! It's hot!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:03.940
That won't stop me-ucha!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:04.950
What?

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.400
Ooh-ooh!

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:09.230
Ucha...

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.210
Pushu.

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:11.240
Pepper!

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:14.660
Time to feast-ooh!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.120
Ucha...

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.080
Slurp!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:20.040
Usacha!

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:25.660
Huh?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.920
The heck was that cow doing-pri?

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:29.720
Pepper!

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:30.460
Huh?

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:32.720
Pepper, halt!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.430
Ooh-ooh?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:34.640
Janice!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.660
Do you really intend to eat Usacha?

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:38.600
Huh?

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:42.560
Indeed, a promise is a promise. But...

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:45.270
I think there might be

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:47.190
something more important!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.650
Janice...

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.810
It's fine, Janice-ucha.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.300
Pepper.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.490
Take me in one gulp-ucha!

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:03.500
You can't-usa! If you wanna eat someone,
eat me! With garlic sauce-usa!

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:08.210
I'd go down great medium-rare-kuma!
Splash some wasabi oil on me-kuma!

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.550
Just kidding!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.690
Huh?

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:22.020
Not eating Usacha!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:26.350
Huh?

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.040
Not eating Usacha!

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.960
But why-ucha?

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.320
You really wanted to-ucha!

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:36.740
But if I eat you, can't talk to you anymore!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.120
<i>We truly did it!
We did it!</i>

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:42.410
Cha...

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.040
Friends are important. Protect friends!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:49.110
Usacha, you're my previous friend!

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:50.290
So not eat you!

00:17:52.610 --> 00:17:53.960
Pepper!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:55.880
Pe...

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.580
Pepper!

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:02.510
Just teasing all of you! It was funny!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:05.140
I'm so glad-usa!

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.730
So glad-kuma!

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:11.690
Besides, you cry so much, becoming all salty.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:17.040
It looks like the bonds
of friendship are tight in NonSugar-pri.

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:20.000
Even beasts can understand each other's hearts.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:20.620
Huh?

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.450
Isn't that great, Usacha?

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.300
I was beside myself with anxiety, you know.

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:26.870
Wait, Janice!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:34.480
What you just said to Pepper made me happy to hear.

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:38.300
Yeah! You do have your kind moments after all, Janice!

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:42.150
What? No, that's not true; I just...

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.220
Wait, Janice!

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:44.060
Hm?

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:46.610
Can eat these?

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:47.310
Huh?

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.520
Don't you dare-kuma!
Don't you dare-usa!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:52.980
If that will preserve the order of things, then so be it.

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.420
And they are nicely grilled already.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.430
Ooh-ooh!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:18:59.440
Gonna eat you!

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:00.950
Don't eat me-kuma!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.680
Hey! Just said could eat you!

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.630
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.510
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.980
Starting the Coord Change.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:27.520
It's the super-popular team coord:

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:32.390
the ribbons on the hips flutter charmingly,
a hit all across PriPara!

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.310
NonSugar Coord!

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:34.770
Non!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:35.360
Chiri!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.440
Ooh-ooh!

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:18.640
Ooh-ooh!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:22.360
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:24.090
Here we go!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.950
By working together!

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:28.360
Fluffy!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:30.850
Tropical!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:33.830
Rich!

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:38.210
Now on sale!

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:39.940
The PriPara sweet:

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:41.690
Fluffy Tropical-Rich!

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:46.180
Super Cyalume Change!

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:53.440
Non!

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:53.850
Chiri!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.900
Ooh-ooh!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.910
Non-chan, be my little sister!

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.500
Chiri-sama, you're so wonderful!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.870
Pepper, licky-stick me!

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:18.770
NonSugar's so sweet! I love you!

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:23.300
As expected, it was a marvellous performance.

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:26.920
Oh dear, what am I saying?

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:37.150
See, this is a photo we took for the first-ever time
you stood up holding on to something.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.750
And next is...

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.610
Mi! Mi-re!

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.600
That's right, that's Mirei.

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:46.070
You played a whole lot with the Prez, too.

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.820
Fi!

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:49.990
Yep!

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:54.120
You went all the way to Prifornia with Sophie, didn't you?

00:21:55.470 --> 00:21:59.740
And you can say everyone's names so well now, too.

00:22:02.900 --> 00:22:04.240
Mama!

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:05.970
Jululu!

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:08.900
That's right, it's Mama and Jululu.

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:12.400
Mama!

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:14.090
Jululu!

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:56.080
It's time for the Last-Chance Rematch Tournament!
I want to cheer everyone on!

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:59.120
You wanna play, Jululu?

00:23:59.950 --> 00:24:02.470
Oh, but I have to go cheer for Ajimi-sensei and the others.

00:24:03.910 --> 00:24:07.290
I've never seen Jululu as fussy as she is today.

00:24:07.290 --> 00:24:08.300
Capisce!

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:12.350
I'll just have to indulge Miss Fussy <i>and</i> cheer everyone on!

00:24:13.420 --> 00:24:17.020
Next time, <i>Everyone Gets a Chance?!
Stand on Stage for Redemption!</i>

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:19.980
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
